<figure class="residual-diagram" aria-label="Residualの2本の経路と加算">
  <figcaption>1層の中で、元の入力と処理した結果が合流する</figcaption>
  <div class="residual-start">
    <strong>入力 x</strong>
    <small>[B,T,1024]</small>
  </div>
  <div class="residual-lanes">
    <div class="residual-compute">
      <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
      <span>RMSNorm</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
      <strong>Attention</strong>
      <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
    </div>
    <div class="residual-bypass">
      <strong>r₁ = 元の x を残す</strong>
      <small>処理する枝の結果と、あとで足す</small>
      <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="residual-join">
    <strong>＋ 要素ごとに加算</strong>
    <small>r₁ + Attentionの出力</small>
  </div>
  <div class="residual-lanes">
    <div class="residual-compute">
      <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
      <span>RMSNorm</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
      <strong>MLP / SwiGLU</strong>
      <small>gate と up → 要素積 → down</small>
      <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
    </div>
    <div class="residual-bypass">
      <strong>r₂ = 合流後の x を残す</strong>
      <small>次の加算のための枝</small>
      <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="residual-join">
    <strong>＋ 要素ごとに加算</strong>
    <small>r₂ + MLPの出力</small>
  </div>
  <div class="residual-end">
    <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
    <strong>次のDecoder Layerへ</strong>
    <small>[B,T,1024]</small>
  </div>
</figure>
